EV/ICE Mechanic Platform – Full Backend Documentation

1️⃣ Overview
Product: On-demand mechanic platform (EV + ICE) for B2C and B2B fleets in Nigeria.
Goals:
Customers can book mechanics, view them on a map, pay securely, and chat in real-time.


Fleets can manage vehicles, dispatch mechanics, monitor EV/ICE metrics.


Admin can audit payments, disputes, and platform operations.


Platform scales horizontally to thousands of concurrent users.


Stack:
Backend: NestJS (modular monolith)


Database: Prisma + PostgreSQL


Queues: BullMQ + Redis (payments, notifications, metrics)


Real-time: Socket.IO + Redis adapter


Scaling: PM2/Kubernetes


Authentication: JWT + RBAC


Security: TLS, AES-256, HTTP headers, rate-limiting



