5️⃣ Business Logic
Bookings:
Multi-segment jobs (battery swap, tires, etc.)


Single or multiple mechanics per booking


Pricing: segment sum + platform fee


EV-only jobs assigned to certified EV mechanics


Payments / Escrow:
Customer pays → escrow → segment completion → release


Partial releases for failed segments


B2B internal jobs → wallet transfer, no escrow


Disputes:
Auto-triage for <NGN10k


Evidence required: photos, GPS, logs


SLA 24hr for admin escalation


RBAC & Multi-Tenancy:
PlatformAdmin → full access


OrgOwner → billing / org settings


OrgAdmin/FleetManager → manage fleet & dispatch


Dispatcher → internal job assignment


Mechanic → multi-org


Customer → personal org, single org booking


EV Safety:
EV badge required for high-voltage jobs


Maximum 50km radius for unproven mechanics



