9️⃣ Scaling & Upgrade Path
MVP (v0.1):
BullMQ + Redis queues, Socket.IO + Redis, monolith → 10k concurrent users


Phase 2 (v0.2):
Telemetry API integrations, AI dispute triage, analytics dashboards


Phase 3 (v1.0):
Kafka event bus, microservices, predictive analytics, high-frequency EV telemetry


Monitoring Triggers:
Redis memory > 80% → add shards


BullMQ queue lag > 5 min → RabbitMQ / microservice split


P95 latency > 500ms → read replicas



